#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:14
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Joining and Moving"
msgstr "Bergabung dan Bergerak"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:21
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Lifecycle"
msgstr "Siklus Hidup"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:7
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Opening Space"
msgstr "Membuka Ruang"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:14
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Choosing"
msgstr "Memilih"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:16
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Click a card to enter the map wearing that character. Everyone else in the Space sees your choice immediately. The picker appears each time you enter, starting on your last pick, so you can switch characters whenever you like."
msgstr ""
"Klik sebuah kartu untuk memasukkan peta memakai karakter itu. Semua orang di"
" ruang angkasa melihat pilihan Anda segera. Picker muncul setiap kali Anda "
"memasukkan, mulai pada pilihan terakhir Anda, sehingga Anda dapat beralih "
"karakter kapanpun Anda suka."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:9
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Eight characters are available: the Hero, plus the Sorceress, Knight, Archer, Barbarian, Rogue, Cleric and Monk. Each card shows an animated walking preview so you can see the sprite before you commit, and every character has its own attack animation too."
msgstr ""
"Delapan karakter tersedia: Pahlawan, ditambah Penyihir, Knight, Archer, "
"Barbarian, Rogue, Pendeta dan Monk. Setiap kartu menunjukkan pertunjukan "
"berjalan animasi sehingga Anda dapat melihat sprite sebelum Anda lakukan, "
"dan setiap karakter memiliki animasi serangan sendiri juga."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:7
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Roster"
msgstr "Roster"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:2
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_choose_character.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When you open a channel's Space, a character picker appears before the map loads. Pick who you want to be — the classic Hero or one of six adventuring classes."
msgstr ""
"Ketika Anda membuka saluran ruang, pemetik karakter muncul sebelum beban "
"peta. Pilih siapa yang kau inginkan - Pahlawan klasik atau salah satu dari "
"enam kelas petualangan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:16
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A landed hit staggers the target and deals damage. Hurt characters show a slim health bar under their name; it disappears once they are back at full health."
msgstr ""
"Mendarat memukul terhuyung target dan menangani kerusakan. Karakter yang "
"terluka menunjukkan sebuah bar kesehatan ramping dengan nama mereka; itu "
"menghilang setelah mereka kembali pada kesehatan penuh."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "At zero HP a character is knocked down and stays on the ground for a few seconds — they cannot move, attack or be attacked while down. They then get back up on their own with full health, ready for the next round."
msgstr ""
"Pada titik nol HP, karakter dijatuhkan dan tetap di tanah selama beberapa "
"detik - mereka tidak bisa bergerak, menyerang atau diserang saat turun. "
"Mereka kemudian kembali pada mereka sendiri dengan kesehatan penuh, siap "
"untuk putaran berikutnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:7
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Attacking"
msgstr "Menyerang"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:2
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Characters in a Space can spar with each other. Combat is friendly by design: a knockout never has any lasting effect, and anyone sitting down is out of the fight entirely."
msgstr ""
"Karakter di ruang angkasa dapat berlatih satu sama lain. Pertarungan itu "
"ramah oleh desain: KO tidak pernah memiliki efek yang bertahan lama, dan "
"siapa pun duduk di luar dari pertempuran sepenuhnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:21
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Knockouts"
msgstr "Knockouts"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:9
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Stand next to another character and press Space — or tap the sword button on the on-screen pad — to swing your weapon. The swing connects with the character on the tile you are facing, or with whoever is standing beside you. Every class swings its own weapon."
msgstr ""
"Berdiri di samping karakter lain dan tekan Space - atau tekan tombol pedang "
"di pad layar on- untuk ayunan senjata Anda. Ayunan terhubung dengan karakter"
" pada ubin Anda hadapi, atau dengan siapa pun yang berdiri di samping Anda. "
"Setiap kelas mengayun senjata sendiri."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:14
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_combat.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Taking hits and health"
msgstr "Mengambil hit dan kesehatan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:39
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:39
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A Space in Its Own Tab"
msgstr "Ruang di Tab Sendiri"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Inviting Someone to a Space"
msgstr "Mengundang Seseorang ke Sebuah Ruang"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:33
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:33
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:17
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:33
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "See also:"
msgstr "Lihat juga:"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:2
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Share, on the character picker, mints a link you can paste anywhere. Pasting it into a conversation draws a card instead of a bare address, and the card says what the link leads to."
msgstr "Bagikan, di pemilih karakter, membuat tautan yang bisa kamu tempel di mana saja. Ditempel ke percakapan, ia menggambar kartu alih-alih alamat mentah, dan kartu itu memberi tahu ke mana tautan itu menuju."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:16
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The address stays good"
msgstr "Alamatnya tetap berlaku"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:35
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:35
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:19
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:19
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:35
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Virtual Spaces"
msgstr "Ruang Virtual"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:8
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What the link carries"
msgstr "Apa yang dibawa tautan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:10
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_share.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Which space it is, and never permission to be in it. A channel's space still asks whoever follows the link to be in that channel, and a private space still belongs to its two people — so a link is an invitation to somewhere you can already reach, not a way around the door. Only a registered nickname can mint one, because the link records who made it."
msgstr "Ruang mana ia, dan tidak pernah izin untuk berada di dalamnya. Ruang sebuah kanal tetap meminta siapa pun yang mengikuti tautan berada di kanal itu, dan ruang privat tetap milik dua orangnya — jadi tautan adalah undangan ke tempat yang sudah bisa kamu capai, bukan cara memutari pintunya. Hanya nama panggilan terdaftar yang bisa membuatnya, karena tautan itu mencatat siapa pembuatnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:8
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Why a tab of its own"
msgstr "Kenapa tab sendiri"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:2
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A space always runs in a browser tab of its own, opened with Space beside the conversation's tabs. The map gets the whole window, and the conversation stays exactly where it was."
msgstr "Ruang selalu berjalan di tab peramban tersendiri, dibuka dengan Space di samping tab percakapan. Peta mendapat seluruh jendela, dan percakapan tetap persis di tempatnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:18
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A space has no beginning and no end: it is a place, so bookmarking its address takes you back to it later. Opening it asks the same questions either way — a channel's space wants you in that channel, and a private space belongs to its two people. The tab always shows a way back to the chat along its bottom edge."
msgstr "Ruang tidak punya awal dan tidak punya akhir: ia sebuah tempat, jadi menyimpan alamatnya sebagai markah membawamu kembali nanti. Membukanya menanyakan hal yang sama seperti biasa — ruang sebuah kanal ingin kamu ada di kanal itu, dan ruang pribadi milik dua orangnya. Tab selalu menunjukkan jalan kembali ke obrolan di tepi bawahnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:2
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A virtual space is the map that belongs to a conversation: every channel has one, and so does every private conversation. Walk around the shared 8-bit world while the conversation carries on beside it."
msgstr "Ruang virtual adalah peta milik sebuah percakapan: setiap kanal punya satu, dan setiap percakapan pribadi juga. Berjalanlah di dunia 8-bit bersama sementara percakapan berlanjut di sebelahnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:16
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Choose a character and you are in. Move with the arrow keys, WASD or the on-screen pad; the server validates every step, so walls and furniture block movement for everyone equally."
msgstr "Pilih karakter dan kamu sudah di dalam. Bergeraklah dengan tombol panah, WASD, atau pad di layar; server memvalidasi setiap langkah, jadi dinding dan perabot menghalangi gerak semua orang dengan sama rata."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:24
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "One tab, not two"
msgstr "Satu tab, bukan dua"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:9
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Space, beside the conversation's tabs, opens it in a browser tab of its own. The conversation stays exactly where it was, and Back to Chat along the space's bottom edge returns to it. There is no command for the map: the entry is the door."
msgstr "Space, di samping tab percakapan, membukanya di tab peramban tersendiri. Percakapan tetap persis di tempatnya, dan Kembali ke obrolan di tepi bawah ruang membawamu kembali ke sana. Tidak ada perintah untuk peta: entri itulah pintunya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:10
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The map is drawn continuously, and inside the chat it shared the browser with everything the chat was doing. In a tab of its own it does not, which is the difference you feel when several people are walking around at once."
msgstr "Peta digambar terus-menerus, dan di dalam obrolan ia berbagi peramban dengan semua yang sedang dilakukan obrolan. Di tab sendiri tidak, dan itulah bedanya saat beberapa orang berjalan-jalan sekaligus."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:23
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_virtual_spaces.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The world itself is runtime state: it wakes when the first person walks in and stops when the last one leaves. What outlives it is the card that walking into an empty one posts in the conversation, which becomes the record of how long the gathering ran and how many people came. The address is a place and never expires."
msgstr "Dunianya sendiri adalah keadaan runtime: ia bangun saat orang pertama masuk dan berhenti saat yang terakhir pergi. Yang bertahan lebih lama adalah kartu yang diposting ke percakapan ketika seseorang masuk ke ruang kosong, dan yang menjadi catatan berapa lama pertemuan itu berlangsung serta berapa orang yang datang. Alamatnya adalah sebuah tempat dan tidak pernah kedaluwarsa."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:39
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Who Is in the Space Right Now"
msgstr "Siapa yang ada di ruang sekarang"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:26
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_tab.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "With that address already open somewhere, the entry says In another tab and takes you to the tab you have. A second tab of a world you are standing in would be a second character nobody asked for."
msgstr "Kalau alamat itu sudah terbuka di suatu tempat, entrinya berbunyi Di tab lain dan membawamu ke tab yang sudah kamu punya. Tab kedua dari dunia tempat kamu sedang berdiri berarti karakter kedua yang tidak diminta siapa pun."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:16
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Once everybody has gone"
msgstr "Setelah semua orang pulang"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:26
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only a registered nickname. A shared address carries somebody accountable for it, which is the same rule every other link in this chat follows. A guest walks into the space exactly as usual; there is simply no card, because there is nobody to put on it."
msgstr "Hanya nama panggilan terdaftar. Alamat yang dibagikan membawa seseorang yang bertanggung jawab atasnya, aturan yang sama yang diikuti setiap tautan lain di obrolan ini. Tamu masuk ke ruang persis seperti biasa; hanya saja tidak ada kartu, karena tidak ada orang untuk dicantumkan di sana."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:10
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The card counts who is inside and names a few of them, and it keeps up on its own as people come and go. Walking into a space somebody is already in posts nothing: one gathering, one card."
msgstr "Kartu itu menghitung siapa saja yang di dalam dan menyebut beberapa nama, dan ia menyesuaikan diri saat orang datang dan pergi. Masuk ke ruang yang sudah ada orangnya tidak memposting apa pun: satu pertemuan, satu kartu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:18
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The same card becomes the record of what happened: how long the gathering ran, and how many different people came. The address itself does not expire — a space is a place — so the entry beside the tabs still opens it, and the next person in starts a new gathering with a card of its own."
msgstr "Kartu yang sama menjadi catatan apa yang terjadi: berapa lama pertemuan itu berlangsung dan berapa orang berbeda yang datang. Alamatnya sendiri tidak kedaluwarsa — ruang adalah sebuah tempat — jadi entri di samping tab tetap membukanya, dan orang berikutnya yang masuk memulai pertemuan baru dengan kartunya sendiri."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:2
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Walking into an empty space posts a card in the conversation it belongs to. It is how everybody reading finds out that something is happening in there, and it is a message like any other: it stays in the scrollback, and somebody scrolling past tomorrow still sees it."
msgstr "Masuk ke ruang kosong memposting kartu di percakapan tempat ruang itu berada. Begitulah semua yang sedang membaca tahu bahwa ada sesuatu yang terjadi di sana, dan itu pesan seperti yang lain: ia tetap ada di riwayat, dan siapa pun yang melewatinya besok masih melihatnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:8
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "While it lasts"
msgstr "Selama berlangsung"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:24
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_space_card.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Who posts one"
msgstr "Siapa yang memposting"
